lines=['# C-PCM blocked qualification','', 'Status: PASS_IMPLEMENTATION_EQUIVALENCE_ONLY. No physical admission and no parent SCF.','', 'The implementation specializes the installed PySCF 2.14.0 SWIG equations: off-diagonal S_ij = erf(xi_i xi_j r_ij / sqrt(xi_i²+xi_j²))/r_ij; diagonal S_ii = xi_i sqrt(2/pi)/switch_i. With f=(eps−1)/eps, q=−f S⁻¹v, q_sym=q, E=q·v/2; the AO potential is the negative AO/charge contraction. No D or dense R is built.','', 'S is constructed in 128-row blocks. S and a reusable Cholesky factor remain resident. AO-surface blocks default to 8; each tensor and fake molecule is explicitly deleted before the next integral call. Reset clears surface, nuclear potential, intermediates/factor, density, energy and AO potential. Factorization failures propagate without regularization or alternate solver. Public attached gradient/Hessian/response/excited-state/post-SCF entry points reject explicitly. Direct use of upstream internal factories is outside this interface.','', '## Observed checks','', '| Case | Cycles | Absolute energy difference (Eh) | Solvent-aware residual | Electron trace error | Wall seconds |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
